1795236181793	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-7982172310472735048"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:01.793-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-20T23:43:01.793-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-nobel"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Published Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Science"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"नोबेल पुरस्कारमा नअटाएको चौथो कुर्सी: परिश्रम शोधकर्ताको, पदक प्रयोगशालाका प्रमुखलाई"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"रिसर्च पेपरमा पहिलो नाम परिश्रम गर्ने शोधकर्ताको हुन्छ, अन्तिम नाम प्रयोगशाला प्रमुखको । तर, नोबेलको मञ्चमा पुग्ने प्रायः अन्तिम नाम नै हो, खोज गर्ने होइन, खोजको नेतृत्व गर्नेहरूको । यो लेख पहिलो पटक २०८३ कात्तिक ३ गते शिलापत्रमा प्रकाशित भएको थियो। शिलापत्रमा प्रकाशित लेखको हेडर । एड बोयडनलाई नचिनेको चिकित्साशास्त्रको नोबेल ५ अक्टुबर २०२६, सोमबार । स्टकहोमको कारोलिन्स्का इन्स्टिच्युटले हरेक वर्षझ"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/7982172310472735048/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/nobel-chautho-kursi.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7982172310472735048"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7982172310472735048"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/nobel-chautho-kursi.html","title":"नोबेल पुरस्कारमा नअटाएको चौथो कुर्सी: परिश्रम शोधकर्ताको, पदक प्रयोगशालाका प्रमुखलाई"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t